use you're grate.":"你是奶酪做的吗？因为你真是太“芝”美了。","I'd ask you to dinner, but you're always so full.":"我想请你吃饭，可你总是满的。","You must be tired, you've been circling my mind all night.":"你一定累了吧，你在我脑子里绕了一整晚。","Is it hot up there, or is it just you?":"上面很热吗，还是只是因为你？","What do you see from up there?":"你从上面能看到什么？","Do you ever get lonely?":"你会觉得孤单吗？","Which city lights do you like best?":"你最喜欢城市里的哪些灯光？","What do you think about all night?":"你整夜都在想什么？","Come down here and talk to me properly.":"下来好好跟我聊聊。","One day I'll fly up there for you.":"总有一天我会为你飞上去。","Admit it, you only shine this bright for me.":"承认吧，你只为我这么亮。","I think you're a little bit in love with me.":"我觉得你有一点点爱上我了。","You're just a big rock.":"你只是块大石头。","The sun's way brighter than you.":"太阳比你亮多了。","Honestly, you're kind of pale.":"说实话，你有点苍白。","Why do you keep following me around?":"你为什么一直跟着我？","That's kind of you. I hear it a lot, you know.":"你真好。不过我常听到这种话哦。","Thank you. You're polite, for an earthling.":"谢谢。作为地球人，你挺有礼貌的。","You came out just for me? That's… nice.":"你是专门为我出来的？那…真好。","Hm. You're sweeter than most of them down there.":"嗯。你比下面大多数人都甜。","Oh — stop it, you'll make me glow.":"哎 — 别说了，我要发光了。","You always know what to say to me.":"你总是知道该对我说什么。","I wait all day for you to come out, you know.":"我一整天都在等你出来，你知道吗。","And you light up mine. Every single night.":"你也照亮了我的。每一个夜晚。","Oh. That was… actually rather lovely.":"哦。这真的…好美。","A poet? I didn't expect that from you.":"诗人？没想到你会这样。","Say that again. Slowly.":"再说一遍。慢慢说。","You've been thinking about me, haven't you?":"你一直在想我，对吧？","Nobody's ever said it like that to me…":"从来没人这样对我说过…","You're going to make me shine brighter than the sun.":"你会让我比太阳还亮。","I'd pull every tide on Earth toward you.":"我愿把地球上所有的潮汐都牵向你。","Keep talking like that and I'll never set.":"你再这样说下去，我就永远不落了。","Ha. Cheesy. But I'll allow it.":"哈，好土。不过算你过关。","That was terrible. I'm laughing anyway.":"太烂了。可我还是笑了。","You're ridiculous. I like it.":"你好荒唐。我喜欢。","Ha! Okay, that one was good.":"哈！好吧，这个不错。","Stop, you're making my craters ache!":"别说了，我的陨石坑都笑疼了！","You always make me laugh, even when it's terrible.":"你总能逗我笑，哪怕很烂。","Only you could make a rock giggle like this.":"只有你能让一块石头这样咯咯笑。","I laughed so hard I nearly eclipsed.":"我笑得差点月食了。","Mostly rooftops. And people who never look up.":"大多是屋顶。还有从不抬头看的人。","Everything. It gets quiet up here.":"什么都想。上面很安静。","I see you, mostly. Walking about at night.":"主要是看你。看你夜里四处走。","Sometimes. The stars don't talk much.":"有时候。星星不太爱说话。","I watch your window to see if you're still up.":"我会看你的窗户，看你睡了没有。","I think about whoever comes out to talk to me.":"我在想那些出来和我说话的人。","I think about you. Is that strange?":"我在想你。这奇怪吗？","Your street. It's my favourite, because you're on it.":"你那条街。那是我最喜欢的，因为你在那里。","Excuse me? We've only just met.":"你说什么？我们才刚认识。","Slow down, earthling.":"慢点，地球人。","Bold. Very bold… I'll think about it.":"好大胆。非常大胆…我考虑一下。","Is that so? We'll see.":"是吗？走着瞧。","Maybe… maybe I do shine a bit more for you.":"也许…也许我真的为你更亮一点。","Don't say things like that, I'll go all red.":"别说这种话，我会脸红的。","Then hurry. I'll be waiting right here.":"那就快点。我就在这里等你。","…Maybe a little. Okay. More than a little.":"…也许有一点。好吧。不止一点。","Well. Goodnight, then.":"好吧。那晚安。","Charming. Truly.":"真迷人。真的。","I thought you were different.":"我以为你不一样。","That hurt more than you'd think.":"这比你想的更伤人。","Why would you say that to me?":"你为什么要对我说这种话？","…I'll just hide behind a cloud for a bit.":"…我先躲到云后面一会儿。","After everything? Really?":"经历了这么多？真的吗？","I didn't think you'd ever say that to me.":"没想到你会对我说这种话。","Oh. Hello down there.":"哦。下面的你好。","Can I help you, earthling?":"有什么事吗，地球人？","You're staring at me again.":"你又在盯着我看了。","You're back. I noticed.":"你回来了。我注意到了。","Out late again, are we?":"又这么晚还在外面？","Oh, it's you. Hi.":"哦，是你。嗨。","There you are! I was hoping you'd come out.":"你在这儿！我就盼着你出来。","Hi, you. I've been waiting.":"嗨，你呀。我一直在等你。","I saved my best glow for you.":"我把最亮的光留给了你。","Finally! I missed you all day.":"终于！我想了你一整天。","My favourite person on the whole planet.":"全星球我最喜欢的人。","I've been shining just for you.":"我只为你发光。","Well. Goodnight, earthling.":"好吧。晚安，地球人。","Goodnight. Maybe come back tomorrow?":"晚安。明天再来吧？","Goodnight… come back tomorrow night, okay?":"晚安…明晚再来，好吗？","Goodnight, my love. I'll watch over you while you sleep.":"晚安，我的爱。你睡着时我会守护你。","Black Beans":"黑豆","Kidney Beans":"红芸豆","Baked Beans":"茄汁焗豆","Canned Chicken":"鸡肉罐头","Tuna":"金枪鱼","Sausages":"香肠","Chicken Soup":"鸡汤","Beef Soup":"牛肉汤","Sweet Corn":"甜玉米","Green Peas":"青豌豆","Green Beans":"四季豆","Sliced Carrots":"胡萝卜片","Milk Chocolate":"牛奶巧克力","Dark Chocolate":"黑巧克力","Caramel Bar":"焦糖棒","Peanut Cups":"花生酱杯","Gummy Bears":"小熊软糖","Sour Worms":"酸虫软糖","Lollipop":"棒棒糖","Mint Drops":"薄荷糖","Cooking Pot":"汤锅","Frying Pan":"平底锅","Drinking Glass":"玻璃杯","Silverware Set":"餐具套装","North":"北","South":"南","Elm":"榆树","Oak":"橡树","Maple":"枫树","Cedar":"雪松","Pine":"松树","Birch":"桦树","Ouch":"哎哟","You fell {0} (−{1} health).":"你摔下了 {0}（健康 −{1}）。","through the hatch":"从舱口","Groceries for your fridge: cheaper than eating out":"冰箱用的食品杂货：比在外面吃便宜","Threads":"Threads","New outfit colours":"新的服装颜色","Spoke & Wheel":"Spoke & Wheel","Paint jobs for your bike":"自行车涂装","Iron Bell Gym":"Iron Bell 健身房","Train to run faster":"训练跑得更快","Bellmont General":"贝尔蒙特综合医院","Treatment and health plans":"治疗和医疗保险","Police Station":"警察局","Pay fines, check your record":"缴纳罚单，查看档案","Bellmont Residences":"Bellmont Residences","Small apartments to rent, first week free":"出租小公寓，首周免费","Sandwich":"三明治","Salad Bowl":"沙拉碗","Pasta Meal":"意面套餐","Unidentified":"未识别","Clear":"晴","Cloudy":"多云","Rain":"雨","Fog":"雾","English":"English","Press back again to exit":"再按一次返回键退出","Loading…":"加载中…","Could not reach the Bellmont server.":"无法连接到贝尔蒙特服务器。","Try again":"重试","Play as guest":"以游客身份游玩","WASD":"WASD","move ·":"移动 ·","Shift":"Shift","run ·":"奔跑 ·","jump ·":"跳跃 ·","interact · hold mouse to look":"互动 · 按住鼠标环顾四周","No room has that code.":"没有这个代码的房间。","That room is full ({0} players).":"房间已满（{0} 名玩家）。","Could not create a room. Please try again.":"无法创建房间，请重